extracting the entire function body into a new function results in

```rust
fn fallible() -> Result<(), ()> {
    match fun_name() {
        Ok(value) => value,
        Err(value) => return value,
    }
}

fn fun_name() -> Result<(), ()> {
    if false {
        return Err(());
    }
    Ok(())
